# Build context hygiene for the three .NET service images (P0-09 Pha B).
#
# The build context is the REPO ROOT, not a project folder: both
# CrmCopilot.MockCrmApi.csproj and CrmCopilot.McpServer.csproj glob into
# ..\..\data\, and central package management lives in the root
# Directory.Packages.props. So exclusions here must be explicit and narrow —
# data/, src/, global.json and Directory.*.props must all stay in the context.

# Build artifacts — never ship the host's bin/obj into the daemon.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# VCS and IDE state
.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.vscode/
.claude/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Secrets and machine-local config. Nothing here may ever reach an image layer:
# GEMINI_API_KEY is injected at runtime by compose only. .env.example is not
# excepted (unlike in .gitignore) because an image has no use for it either.
.env*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json

# Test output and logs
TestResults/
coverage*
**/*.log

# Not needed to build or run a service image
tests/
docs/
**/*.md
CrmCopilot.slnLaunch.user
